Settlement listings are read from the public pages of Top Class Actions (topclassactions.com), ClassAction.org and
OpenClassActions (openclassactions.com). Each listing links back to its source. ClaimScout fetches them from the
user's own PC, a few requests every six hours.

Company logos are shown on the user's own device, fetched from the sources above or the company's own website.
They are trademarks of their owners and are used only to identify the company a settlement is about.

ClaimScout is an independent project. It is not affiliated with, or endorsed by, any settlement administrator, law
firm, listing site or company named in a settlement.
